RESOLVED that the Articles of Association of the company be and are hereby altered in the following manner:
 
(i)	After Article 5 the following new Articles to be headed 'MANAGING DIRECTORS'and numbered 5A to 5D shall be inserted as under:
 
5A. Subject to the provisions of sections 197A, 269, 316 and 317 of the Companies Act, 1956, the Board may from time to time appoint one or more Directors to be the Managing Director or Managing Director…";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:5:"title";N;s:11:"last_change";a:4:{s:4:"date";N;s:4:"user";N;s:2:"ip";N;s:3:"sum";N;}}s:10:"persistent";a:3:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1752581524;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";}}